== Main Views Development

The interface was segmented to meet the specific needs of two types of profiles: standard users and administrators.

=== User Interface
The view intended for end users was designed to be direct and informative, revolving around three main tabs:

* Overview (Dashboard) *: This central screen highlights the parking availability. It displays the user's active charging session in real time, or alternatively, the details of their last session. Global metrics complete this view.\
* My Sessions *: A summary table offering the complete history of charging sessions, with filtering capabilities.\
* My Badges *: A management interface allowing the addition, modification, or revocation of RFID or NFC badges associated with the user's profile.

