#pagebreak()
=== Administrator Interface
Accounts with elevated rights have access to a set of advanced supervision and configuration tools, distributed across several views:

* Global Supervision *: The fleet's control center. It consolidates the status of all chargers, the instantaneous power drawn by the system, and the total energy distributed. A graph based on a 24-hour sliding time window traces the precise evolution of the overall load, complemented by an exhaustive list of active sessions.\
* Charging Stations *: The hardware configuration interface. It allows for listing the stations, defining their priority levels, and accessing the management of power blocks to configure the electrical limits of the power supply groups.\
* Badge Management *: An extended view allowing the supervision of all system badges (recognized and unknown) and the auditing of sessions linked to a specific identifier.\
* Users *: The account administration panel, allowing for the modulation of permissions and the inspection of transaction volumes per collaborator.

