=== Detailed Views and Profile
Regardless of the authorization level, clicking on a transaction (from any view) opens a detailed analysis screen of the charging session. This screen renders the temporal curve of the power drawn via an interactive chart and consolidates key indicators. For administrators, this view is enriched with a technical activity log listing the station's events, a diagnostic capability made possible by the richness of the OCPP protocol frames.

#figure(
  image("../resources/img/session_detail.png", width: 100%),
  caption: [Detailed view of a charging session (with the power variation curve).],
) <fig:session_detail>

Finally, a profile configuration section is available for each account, ensuring user autonomy in managing their personal data and login credentials.